Subject: [PATCH] feat(project): use the folder name outside git instead of
 promoting child repositories

Keep non-Git workspace identity local to the requested directory and preserve historical provenance compatibility.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
